exports[`what an agent reads, word for word > search: toggle 1`] = `
"@idyeah/diya 1.1.0 · 4 for "toggle for email notifications"

1. Switch · \`import { Switch } from '@idyeah/diya'\`
   For a setting that takes effect the moment it flips, like notifications.
   Not quite? Part of a form that is saved with a button? A checkbox (Choice with multiple) reads more honestly.
2. Text Input · \`import { TextInput } from '@idyeah/diya'\`
   For one line of free text: a name, an email, a URL.
   Not quite? Several lines? Text Area. A fixed set of answers? Select or Choice.
3. Alert · \`import { Alert } from '@idyeah/diya'\`
   For a message about the page or a task: saved, needs attention, failed. Toast is the same message, floated and temporary.
   Not quite? Something that needs a decision before going on? Dialog.
4. Toast · \`import { Toast } from '@idyeah/diya'\`
   A temporary Alert floated above the page that dismisses itself after a while; the host unmounts the toast in \`onDismiss\`. \`className\`, \`style\` and the ref reach the Alert.

Next: get_component with a name, for its props and a complete file."
`;
